  "sections": [
    {
      "sectionId": "section-introduction",
      "heading": "Introduction",
      "sourceAnchor": "introduction",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-introduction-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The Order’s Resilience feat offers two defensive benefits intended for front-line martial characters. Unfortunately, the features are both only situationally useful, and you may go huge stretches of time with this feat providing absolutely no benefit. "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sectionId": "section-ability-score-increase",
      "heading": "Ability Score Increase",
      "sourceAnchor": "ability-score-increase",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-ability-score-increase-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Great ability scores for many martial characters."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sectionId": "section-resurge",
      "heading": "Resurge",
      "sourceAnchor": "resurge",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-resurge-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\n\tVery few enemies have a way to knock you Prone, so this will rarely see use.\n\tEven if you do fall Prone, you’ll often want to stand but remain in melee, so\n\tsaving a few feet of movement won’t matter.\n"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sectionId": "section-stronger-together",
      "heading": "Stronger Together",
      "sourceAnchor": "stronger-together",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-stronger-together-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Strength saves are rare. You can’t even use them to escape grapples since that’s done with Strength (Athletics) or Dexterity (Acrobatics). "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
